      "writtenOn": "2015-07-29T16:16:54Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "Where is the interrupt getting re-enabled? With your check above (!(gpio_get_level(GPIO_FAN_ALERT_L)), if the alert pin goes low to trigger the interrupt, but is high by the time the deferred function is called, your interrupt will be disabled forever. Is that really what you want?",
      "revId": "4c5efef90131db6045bcac110f9e7c887680c0bf",
