      "writtenOn": "2015-07-30T01:27:53Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "Alert pin only can goes high when EC do status_read8(\u0026alert_status) to clear alert status in cool down status.\nInterrupt will be enable after EC clear status.\nEC will enter hibernate every time when interrupt happen, and interrupt will be re-enable after EC wake up init.",
      "parentUuid": "8d11d20b_6057e430",
      "revId": "4c5efef90131db6045bcac110f9e7c887680c0bf",
